#============================================================================
# JARVIS INTEGRATION — PURE SYMBOLIC SPECIFICATION
# Date: 2026-03-27
# Purpose: Integration of JARVIS web interface with ARIA kernel
# Format: Pure algebraic/symbolic (no code, no algorithms)
